dhp423:1 starts: He knows
dhp423:2 starts: He sees
dhp423:3 starts: has attained
dhp423:4 starts: is a sage
dhp423:5 starts: his mastery totally mastered:
dhp423:6 starts: he’s what I call
iti2:3.1 starts: The aversion with which
iti2:3.2 starts: beings go to a bad destination,
iti2:3.3 starts: from rightly knowing that aversion,
iti2:3.4 starts: those who see clearly
iti2:3.5 starts: Letting go,
iti2:3.6 starts: they never come to this world
iti3:3.1 starts: The delusion with which
iti3:3.2 starts: beings go to a bad destination,
iti3:3.3 starts: from rightly knowing that delusion,
iti3:3.4 starts: those who see clearly
iti3:3.5 starts: Letting go,
iti3:3.6 starts: they never come to this world
