iti4:3.2 starts: beings go to a bad destination,
iti4:3.3 starts: from rightly knowing that anger,
iti4:3.4 starts: those who see clearly
iti4:3.5 starts: Letting go,
iti4:3.6 starts: they never come to this world
iti5:3.1 starts: The contempt with which
iti5:3.2 starts: beings go to a bad destination,
iti5:3.3 starts: from rightly knowing that contempt,
iti5:3.4 starts: those who see clearly
iti5:3.5 starts: Letting go,
