iti14:3.1 starts: No one other thing
iti14:3.2 starts: so hinders people
iti14:3.3 starts: that they wander on, day & night,
iti14:3.4 starts: as when they’re obstructed
iti20:5.1 starts: as if he were carried off
iti20:5.2 starts: and placed there.
iti20:5.3 starts: It’s because of corrupt-mindedness
iti20:5.4 starts: that beings go
